flowchart TD
    User[Pet owner] --> UI[Streamlit: current user / Pets / Community calendar]
    UI --> Manual[Manual task entry]
    UI --> Conversation[Typed conversation]
    Store[(Local SQLite)] --> Context[Relevant pets and tasks]
    Context --> Gemini[Gemini structured planner]
    Conversation --> Gemini
    Conversation --> Dictation[Microphone dictation: Gemini Flash]
    Dictation --> Conversation
    Conversation --> Live[Gemini Live: one-use restricted credential]
    Live --> Spoken{Owner confirms aloud?}
    Spoken -->|changes| Live
    Spoken -->|yes| VoiceSave[Validate latest proposal and spoken confirmation]
    VoiceSave --> Service
    Live -->|edit instead| Preview
    Store --> Shared[Read-only schedules across owners]
    Shared --> UI
    Gemini --> Validator[Validate fields and check same-date conflicts]
    Manual --> Validator
    Validator -->|missing details| Clarify[Ask a clarifying question]
    Clarify --> Conversation
    Validator --> Preview[Editable task preview]
    Preview --> Confirm{Owner confirms?}
    Confirm -->|keep draft| UI
    Confirm -->|yes| Service[Validate current owner and save once]
    Service --> Domain[Owner / Pet / Task / Scheduler]
    Domain --> Store
    Store --> Readback[Verify saved task]
    Readback --> UI
    Gemini -->|unavailable| Manual
    UI --> Maps[Map search from confirmed location]
